      "review_description": "Ryan from Greenhouse Electrical was the first quote that I requested after deciding to choose to install solar. I was very impressed with Ryan's recommendations and explanations of the various options available. After receiving another 10 or so quotes, I ended up choosing Greenhouse Electrical because of the clear commitment to a long lasting and quality components. The installation was of an excellent standard, and Ryan was meticulous in ensuring that the panels, inverter and other components were located to maximise their performance and longevity. The install was also neat with almost no visible external conduit or wiring. Ryan was always responsive with his communication and did not employ any pressure tactics. As a result, I have recommended Greenhouse Electrical services to numerous friends and family members.",
