      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Ryan was by far and away the best of the three  quotes, both in professionalism and knowledgeHe knows the subject and asked all of the right questions.He came up with alternatives, requested a copy of my bill to peruse and referred me to a website from which I was able to get some yearly data.He checked my Meter,Power board, House orientation and was quite willing to put an Inverter in my garage.His quotation was well set-out and came with all the relevant information regarding Solar panel types, Inverter types, Graphs on my usage and potential Solar power generationHe made recommendations and gave reasons why.He was not the cheapest or dearest and gave a 30 day acceptance window.He also gave a 10 year workmanship warranty with a subsequent 3 month visit after installation to verify that everything is working correctly.All this in writing.Ryan was always on time, he did everything he said he would, and nothing was to much trouble for him. My installation and final inspection went smoothlyI would thoroughly recommend him and his company to anyone considering Solar Electricity",
